      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Executive Order No. 103, the subject of which was \"AMENDMENT OR MODIFICATION OF ADMINISTRATIVE CODE AND/OR NEW CHARTER.\" Of the 66 Departments only 18 have complied with the Order. Possibly through misunderstanding, most of the replies received stress amendment of the new Charter and only incidentally, recommend Administrative Code changes. Many changes will have to be made in the Code and relatively few in the new Charter.",
      "logprob_stats": {
